[0.473, "o", "\u001b[38;5;242m#\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;242m Demo 4 — in-place major upgrade PG 17 -> 18. Same OS family (trixie) is required.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;5;242m#\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;242m Operator stops the cluster, runs pg_upgrade --link in `<primary>-major-upgrade`,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[38;5;242m#\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;242m then re-clones the replicas. PG 18 preserves optimizer stats; extended statistics\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;5;242m#\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;242m are NOT preserved, so still ANALYZE. Every base backup is still PG 17 - take a new one.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[38;5;203mspec\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;231m:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[38;5;231m  \u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;203mimageName\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;231m:\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;231m \u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;186mghcr.io/cloudnative-pg/postgresql:18.6-minimal-trixie\u001b[0m\r\n"]
